## What I made
A small student portal with Laravel. A user can register, log in,
see a dashboard, and log out. Only logged-in users can open the dashboard.

## How to run
```bash
composer create-project laravel/laravel it-auth-lab "^12.0"
cd it-auth-lab
```
Edit `.env`:
```
DB_CONNECTION=mysql
DB_HOST=127.0.0.1
DB_PORT=3306
DB_DATABASE=it_auth_lab
DB_USERNAME=root
DB_PASSWORD=
SESSION_DRIVER=file
```
Create an empty database named `it_auth_lab` in phpMyAdmin, then:
```bash
php artisan config:clear
php artisan migrate
php artisan make:controller AuthController
php artisan serve
```

